[{"id":"CN-IP-003","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["CIDR","历史迁移"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址","articlePath":"posts/5bd659bc/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址","articlePath":"posts/5bd659bc/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":17,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么现代地址规划不能继续按 Class A/B/C 作为主规则？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>CIDR 使用任意前缀长度，路由和地址规划以 prefix length 为准；分类地址只能作为历史背景。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Class A/B/C 是早期按地址首段划分固定网络大小的分类地址模型，难以按实际规模灵活分配；CIDR 用前缀长度表达网络边界，路由也按前缀匹配。私有地址范围是“能否在公网路由”的用途划分，不是 Class A/B/C 的替代分类。回答旧资料时应明确历史背景，再说明当前按 CIDR、重叠检查和路由公告规划。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>例如 \u003ccode>10.0.0.0/8\u003c/code> 是私有地址块，但仍可继续切成 \u003ccode>/16\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>/24\u003c/code> 等不同前缀；这正是分类地址无法表达的灵活性。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-HTTP-004","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTP","GET","POST","PUT","PATCH"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(八)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(八)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/e470b049/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":16,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>GET、POST、PUT、PATCH、DELETE 的核心边界是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>GET 获取，POST 提交处理或创建，PUT 以给定表示创建/替换，PATCH 做部分修改，DELETE 删除目标当前关联；具体资源语义仍由 API 契约定义。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>方法表达的是对资源的意图，不是“有没有请求体”的语法开关：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>方法\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>常见语义\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>幂等/安全的典型边界\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>GET\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>获取表示\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>通常安全且幂等\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>POST\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>创建或执行一次动作\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>通常非幂等\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>PUT\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>用给定表示替换目标\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>按契约通常幂等\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>PATCH\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>对目标做部分修改\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>是否幂等取决于补丁语义\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>DELETE\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>删除目标\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>最终状态通常幂等，但响应和副作用仍由契约定义\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>不要把 \u003ccode>POST\u003c/code> 等同于“有请求体”、\u003ccode>PUT\u003c/code> 等同于“全量更新”；要结合资源模型、重复请求风险、状态码和应用 API 契约判断。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-HTTP-FAQ-003","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTP","浏览器","curl","CORS"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障","articlePath":"posts/61ba71fc/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/"}],"articleIndex":14,"articleCount":16,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么浏览器失败而 curl 成功？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>两者的请求上下文不同。浏览器可能执行同源策略、CORS 预检、Cookie SameSite、缓存和证书策略，curl 通常只按命令参数发送请求。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>浏览器和 \u003ccode>curl\u003c/code> 的请求上下文可能不同：浏览器会执行同源策略和 CORS，可能自动带符合规则的 Cookie，使用页面代理和证书策略，还会处理 Fetch 的重定向/凭据模式；\u003ccode>curl\u003c/code> 默认不会替你执行这些浏览器限制。复现时记录 Origin、方法、实际请求头、凭据、证书和重定向链，不能只复制 URL。\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>差异\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>浏览器可能做什么\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>\u003ccode>curl\u003c/code> 默认行为\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>跨源读取\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>检查 CORS 响应头\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>通常直接显示响应\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>会话材料\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>按 Cookie/SameSite 等规则发送\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>需显式提供 Cookie\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>页面上下文\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>受代理、证书和 Origin 影响\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>由命令参数决定\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>因此 \u003ccode>curl\u003c/code> 成功只能证明该命令的请求成功，不能直接证明页面中的 Fetch 成功。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-MOD-FAQ-005","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTPS","证书","安全"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP","articlePath":"posts/36cb963b/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP","articlePath":"posts/36cb963b/"}],"articleIndex":13,"articleCount":13,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>证书错误时加 -k 是正确修复吗？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不是。\u003ccode>-k\u003c/code> 关闭客户端证书校验，只适合明确隔离的临时测试。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>curl -k\u003c/code> (或 \u003ccode>--insecure\u003c/code>) 会关闭客户端对证书的校验，只能作为隔离测试中确认“应用层是否另有响应”的临时手段；它会掩盖中间人攻击、错误主机和过期证书，不能算生产修复。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>正式修复应按顺序检查证书链、SAN、客户端信任库、SNI/虚拟主机和系统时间。测试环境需要自签名证书时，应把获准的测试 CA 以显式 \u003ccode>--cacert\u003c/code> 提供，而不是关闭所有校验或修改全局信任库。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"app-testing-release-decision","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"App测试","tags":["项目实战","发布"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(十七)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"App测试(十七)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/c0a414ba/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(十七)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"App测试(十七)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/c0a414ba/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>App 测试项目什么时候可以给出发布候选结论？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>高风险旅程和必测矩阵已验证，Crash/ANR 等稳定性异常有处置，失败证据可复现，残余风险有明确签收或阻断决定。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>发布候选 (release candidate) 是“可以进入发布评审的构建”，不是已经发布。结论不是“所有用例都绿”，而是覆盖、稳定性、证据和风险四类输入共同满足门禁：环境失败、跳过和数据不足要单独统计；关键字段缺失时应阻断或回到补测，不能把未执行当成通过。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"fastapi-0141-404-405-422","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["错误定位","HTTP"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(三)路由与请求解析.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(三)路由与请求解析","articlePath":"posts/fcf9c728/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(三)路由与请求解析.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(三)路由与请求解析","articlePath":"posts/fcf9c728/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>404、405 与 422 分别在哪个阶段产生？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>404 在路径匹配失败时产生，405 在路径匹配但方法不允许时产生，422 在命中处理函数前的输入校验失败时产生。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>可以把请求看成三道门：第一道匹配路径，第二道检查方法，第三道解析和校验参数。404 没有可用路由；405 应检查 \u003ccode>Allow\u003c/code>；422 则应读取 \u003ccode>detail.loc\u003c/code> 回到具体来源。处理函数没有被调用是 422 的重要证据，修复应优先改签名或请求，而不是在函数内部捕获异常。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"fastapi-0141-testclient-vs-asyncclient","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["测试","客户端"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十二)测试与质量保障.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十二)测试与质量保障","articlePath":"posts/d474d6f1/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十二)测试与质量保障.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十二)测试与质量保障","articlePath":"posts/d474d6f1/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>TestClient\u003c/code> 与 \u003ccode>AsyncClient\u003c/code> 如何选择？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>同步 HTTP 和 lifespan 快速验证用 TestClient；需要异步数据库、并发或流式消费时用 AsyncClient 加 ASGITransport。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>TestClient 把 ASGI 调用包装成同步接口，适合普通路由和上下文管理；AsyncClient 让测试可以 \u003ccode>await\u003c/code> 异步依赖、并发任务和流式迭代。两者都不经过真实网络，代理/TLS/多进程需另测。需要 lifespan 时，TestClient 必须使用 \u003ccode>with\u003c/code>；异步客户端则要配合专门的 lifespan fixture。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a3-safe-delete","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["文件操作","安全"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(三)文件与存储管理.md","articleTitle":"Linux(三)文件与存储管理","articlePath":"posts/5297e207/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(三)文件与存储管理.md","articleTitle":"Linux(三)文件与存储管理","articlePath":"posts/5297e207/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>执行删除命令前最小的安全检查是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>用 pwd 确认当前位置，用 ls -ld 或 find 列出精确目标，并确认没有把变量展开为空或指向根目录。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>删除前把“当前目录”和“目标集合”都打印出来，再执行动作：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;cwd=%s\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$PWD\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">find ./work -maxdepth 1 -\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">type\u003c/span> f -name \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;*.tmp&#x27;\u003c/span> -\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">read\u003c/span> -r -p \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;确认删除以上文件？[y/N] &#x27;\u003c/span> reply\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">if\u003c/span> [[ \u003cspan class=\"variable\">$reply\u003c/span> == y ]]; \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">then\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  find ./work -maxdepth 1 -\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">type\u003c/span> f -name \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;*.tmp&#x27;\u003c/span> -delete\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">fi\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>rmdir\u003c/code> 只接受空目录，\u003ccode>rm\u003c/code> 和 \u003ccode>unlink\u003c/code> 更容易造成不可逆损失。变量为空、通配符未匹配或当前路径位于真实挂载点时，命令的目标集合可能完全变形；生产操作必须另有备份和恢复窗口。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a2-wsl-container","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Linux","tags":["WSL2","容器","虚拟机"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(二)系统与命令行基础.md","articleTitle":"Linux(二)系统与命令行基础","articlePath":"posts/6153b09f/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(二)系统与命令行基础.md","articleTitle":"Linux(二)系统与命令行基础","articlePath":"posts/6153b09f/"}],"articleIndex":7,"articleCount":7,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么 WSL2 或容器中的 uname 与 /etc/os-release 可能描述不同环境？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>uname 描述当前运行的内核，/etc/os-release 描述用户空间发行版；虚拟化或容器可以把二者拆在不同边界。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>容器通常共享宿主机内核，却携带自己的用户空间文件；WSL2 还会把 Linux 用户空间放在虚拟化内核之上。可以把证据分开记录：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">uname\u003c/span> -r                  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 内核边界\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">cat\u003c/span> /etc/os-release       \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 发行版边界\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">type\u003c/span> -a \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">ls\u003c/span>                \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 命令提供者\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">command\u003c/span> -v systemd || \u003cspan class=\"literal\">true\u003c/span>  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 当前环境是否提供该入口\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>若三组结果不属于同一个版本族，不应写成“机器版本为某某”；应说明是“某发行版用户空间运行在某内核上”，并继续检查容器、WSL 或虚拟机边界。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-iteration-lazy","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","惰性","生成器","管道"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(六)迭代器、生成器与装饰器.md","articleTitle":"Python(六)迭代器、生成器与装饰器","articlePath":"posts/be636c04/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(六)迭代器、生成器与装饰器.md","articleTitle":"Python(六)迭代器、生成器与装饰器","articlePath":"posts/be636c04/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>惰性迭代的收益和风险是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>它按需计算，能节省不必要的工作和内存；风险是数据会被一次性耗尽，错误和资源问题也会延后出现。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>惰性管道只在消费时计算，输入大或后续可能提前停止时能节省工作和内存；代价是它有状态且错误会延后：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">stream = (value * \u003cspan class=\"number\">2\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">for\u003c/span> value \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">in\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">range\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"number\">3\u003c/span>))\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">first = \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">next\u003c/span>(stream)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">rest = \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">list\u003c/span>(stream)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(first, rest)  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 0 [2, 4]\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>如果需要重复遍历、快照或随机访问，应明确物化为列表或重新创建来源。调试时调用 \u003ccode>list(stream)\u003c/code> 会消耗迭代器，之后的生产代码可能只得到空结果；资源型迭代器还必须在消费或关闭边界设计清理。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]